  "question": {
    "text": "The nuclear activity of a radioactive element becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mtext>th&#160;</mtext></msup></math> of its initial value in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> years. The half-life of radioactive element is ________&nbsp;years."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>years</mi></math></p>"
  }
